{"id":"n14356-1-2","stage":4,"title":"대체 · 大体","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14356-1-2-1","ko":"저 사람 아까부터 계속 울기만 하던데 대체 왜 그러는 거야?","zh":"那个人从刚才开始就一直在哭，到底为什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"아까부터","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까부터","audio":"/audio/ce21fb59ded82e3bd3d0.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"울기만","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"7","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울기만","audio":"/audio/962bffb19e9d2939c00e.mp3"}},{"text":"하던데","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하던데","audio":"/audio/0104159ac29c5e3e0bbe.mp3"}},{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟。","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14356","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그러는","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러는","audio":"/audio/c657b56201417b8ad444.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"人","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"一边发出声音，一边流眼泪。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"baa66ff689021a3f","term":"대체","zh":"到底、究竟","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3","entryId":"14356","definition":"到底、究竟","pronunciation":["대ː체"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6ad833ee4e7d3e5e5b2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14356-1-2-2","ko":"나도 정말 모르겠어.","zh":"我真的一点都不知道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b922fc09f44af969907.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14356","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1455,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我真的一点都不知道。","那个人从刚才开始就一直在哭，到底为什么啊？","照片拍得好看吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个人从刚才开始就一直在哭，到底为什么啊？","照片拍得好看吗？","我真的一点都不知道。"],"answer":2}]}
